[{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0276","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0276.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-4394","title":"RealNetworks RealPlayer RealPix 服务器头堆缓冲区溢出代码执行漏洞","description":"RealNetworks RealPlayer 11.0 至 11.1 版本及 RealPlayer SP 1.0 至 1.1.5 版本在解析 RealPix 文件时，对 HTTP 响应中的 Server 头部长度缺乏边界检查，存在基于堆的缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可搭建恶意 Web 服务器，诱导用户打开 RealPix 链接，在 HTTP 响应中构造超长 Server 头部，触发堆内存破坏，进而在用户上下文中执行任意代码。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 9.3（AV:N/AC:M/Au:N/C:C/I:C/A:C），影响范围广泛，攻击条件为用户访问恶意链接且使用受影响版本 RealPlayer，利用方式为远程代码执行。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2010-4394"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-12-14T16:00:05Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:24:42Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 RealPlayer 至 12.0.1.609 或更高版本（RealPlayer SP 升级至 1.1.6+），可从 RealNetworks 官网下载最新安装包覆盖安装。若暂时无法升级，建议卸载 RealPlayer 并改用其他播放器，或在防火墙层面拦截来自不可信站点的 HTTP 响应中异常长的 Server 头部作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://osvdb.org/69853","http://service.real.com/realplayer/security/12102010_player/en/","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1024861","http://www.zerodayinitiative.com/advisories/ZDI-10-282","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/145038fbd12ba507a810d82f3ca7bed9554ecf9f/cves/2010/4xxx/CVE-2010-4394.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-4394","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2010-4394.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/68711f4b9de04c730603adbbe0fe7b126b6784b4/CVE/data/2010/CVE-2010-4394.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/effb2f348554323580d029ec0e691334888b7fed/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-96gg-2fqg-g6xm/GHSA-96gg-2fqg-g6xm.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2010/gb_realplayer_mult_vuln_win_dec10.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_114300_114400.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x46000/45458/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2010/CVE-2010-4394.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/R/realplayer_12_0_1_609.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0276.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0275","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0275.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-4392","title":"RealNetworks RealPlayer ImageMap 堆缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"RealNetworks RealPlayer 11.0至11.1、RealPlayer SP 1.0至1.1.5、RealPlayer Enterprise 2.1.2及2.1.3、Linux RealPlayer 11.0.2.1744以及HelixPlayer 1.0.6等版本中存在基于堆的缓冲区溢出漏洞。该漏洞源于RealMedia文件中ImageMap数据的整数计算错误，导致在处理特制的ImageMap数据时发生堆缓冲区溢出。远程攻击者可通过诱导用户打开包含恶意ImageMap数据的RealMedia文件触发此漏洞，成功利用后可实现任意代码执行，完全控制受影响系统。CVSS评分9.3，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2010-4392"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-12-14T16:00:05Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:24:42Z","remediation":"立即升级 RealPlayer 至 12.0.1.609 或更高版本；Linux 用户升级 HelixPlayer 至 1.0.6 以上补丁版本（参考 RHSA-2010-0981）。如无法升级，在浏览器中禁用 RealPlayer ActiveX 控件，并避免打开来源不明的 .rm/.ra 媒体文件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://osvdb.org/69852","http://service.real.com/realplayer/security/12102010_player/en/","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2010-0981.html","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1024861","http://www.zerodayinitiative.com/advisories/ZDI-10-280","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/145038fbd12ba507a810d82f3ca7bed9554ecf9f/cves/2010/4xxx/CVE-2010-4392.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-4392","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2010-4392.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/68711f4b9de04c730603adbbe0fe7b126b6784b4/CVE/data/2010/CVE-2010-4392.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/effb2f348554323580d029ec0e691334888b7fed/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-fwwr-mh49-42xf/GHSA-fwwr-mh49-42xf.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2011/gb_CESA-2010_0981_HelixPlayer-uninstall_centos4_i386.nasl","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/C/centos_RHSA-2010-0981.nasl","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x46000/45452/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_114300_114400.json","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/oraclelinux_ELSA-2010-0981.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0275.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0508","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0508.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-4345","title":"Exim 邮件传输代理权限提升漏洞","description":"Exim 4.72 及更早版本中存在权限提升漏洞，本地攻击者可利用 exim 用户账户指定包含任意命令的替代配置文件（如 spool_directory 指令），从而以 root 权限执行任意命令。该漏洞源于 Exim 对配置文件处理不当，未充分校验配置指令中的命令参数。攻击者需拥有 exim 用户账户权限即可触发，影响所有 Exim 4.72 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2010-4345"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2010-12-14T16:00:04Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:24:36Z","remediation":"升级 Exim 至 4.73 或更高版本，该版本通过限制配置文件指令中的命令执行修复了此漏洞。如无法立即升级，应移除 exim 用户的 shell 登录权限（usermod -s /sbin/nologin exim），并确保 exim 用户不属于 sudo 或 wheel 等特权组，防止本地提权。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://bugs.exim.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1044","http://lists.exim.org/