],"published":"2010-12-14T16:00:04Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:24:41Z","remediation":"立即升级 RealPlayer 至 12.0.1.609 或更高版本，该版本已修复 IVR 文件头解析中的堆缓冲区溢出漏洞。如无法升级，可在浏览器中禁用 RealPlayer 插件，并避免打开来源不明的 .ivr/.rm/.ra 媒体文件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://osvdb.org/69850","http://service.real.com/realplayer/security/12102010_player/en/","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1024861","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/145038fbd12ba507a810d82f3ca7bed9554ecf9f/cves/2010/4xxx/CVE-2010-4390.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-4390","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2010-4390.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/68711f4b9de04c730603adbbe0fe7b126b6784b4/CVE/data/2010/CVE-2010-4390.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/effb2f348554323580d029ec0e691334888b7fed/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-f6fc-pffh-c6vq/GHSA-f6fc-pffh-c6vq.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2010/gb_realplayer_mult_vuln_win_dec10.nasl","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--fffc56a4-1847-48f2-b326-aaabbecd78c5.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/R/realplayer_12_0_1_609.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2010/CVE-2010-4390.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_overflow.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0273.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0272","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0272.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-4388","title":"RealNetworks RealPlayer 跨域脚本执行漏洞","description":"RealNetworks RealPlayer 的 Upsell.htm、Main.html 和 Custsupport.html 组件存在跨域脚本漏洞，由于对用户输入验证不充分，远程攻击者可通过诱导用户访问特制网页，向 RealOneActiveXObject 进程注入恶意代码，从而绕过 Internet Explorer 的本地计算机区域安全限制，加载任意 ActiveX 控件。该漏洞影响 RealPlayer 11.0~11.1、RealPlayer SP 1.0~1.1.5 及 RealPlayer Enterprise 2.1.2/2.1.3 版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可实施攻击，CVSS 评分 4.3，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2010-4388"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-12-14T16:00:04Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:24:41Z","remediation":"立即升级 RealPlayer 至 12.0.1.609 或更高版本，该版本已修复跨域脚本绕过漏洞。如无法升级，可禁用 RealPlayer 浏览器 ActiveX 控件（在 IE 管理加载项中禁用 RealOneActiveXObject），并将 Internet 区域安全级别设为高，同时禁用本地 HTML 文件执行 ActiveX 脚本的权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://osvdb.org/69857","http://osvdb.org/69858","http://osvdb.org/69859","http://service.real.com/realplayer/security/12102010_player/en/","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1024861","http://www.zerodayinitiative.com/advisories/ZDI-10-276","http://www.zerodayinitiative.com/advisories/ZDI-10-277","http://www.zerodayinitiative.com/advisories/ZDI-10-278","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/145038fbd12ba507a810d82f3ca7bed9554ecf9f/cves/2010/4xxx/CVE-2010-4388.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-4388","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2010-4388.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/68711f4b9de04c730603adbbe0fe7b126b6784b4/CVE/data/2010/CVE-2010-4388.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/effb2f348554323580d029ec0e691334888b7fed/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-qw2f-744w-3w38/GHSA-qw2f-744w-3w38.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2010/gb_realplayer_mult_vuln_win_dec10.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_114300_114400.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/R/realplayer_12_0_1_609.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2010/CVE-2010-4388.json","https://github.com/sailuh/perceive/blob/85ca622832e25fa91d8d836b8c93a096178bb35d/Notebooks/NVD/data/2010.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0272.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0271","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0271.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-4387","title":"RealNetworks RealPlayer RealAudio编解码器堆内存破坏远程代码执行漏洞","description":"RealNetworks RealPlayer 的 RealAudio 编解码器存在内存破坏漏洞，远程攻击者可通过构造特制的 RealMedia 文件中的音频流触发堆内存损坏，导致任意代码执行或拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 RealPlayer 11.0~11.1、RealPlayer SP 1.0~1.1.4、Mac 版 11.0~12.0.0.1444 及 Linux 版 11.0.2.1744，攻击者只需诱使用户打开恶意媒体文件即可触发，无需额外认证，CVSS 评分 9.3，危害严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2010-4387"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-12-14T16:00:04Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:24:41Z","remediation":"立即升级 RealPlayer 至 12.0.1.609 或更高版本。Windows 用户可通过 RealPlayer 内置更新功能（帮助→检查更新）获取最新版，或从 RealNetworks 官网下载安装包覆盖安装。Linux 用户应升级至 11.0.2.1744 以上版本。如无法立即升级，建议在浏览器中禁用 RealPlayer 插件，并避免打开来源不明的 .rm/.ra 媒体文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://labs.idefense.com/intelligence/vulnerabilities/display.php?id=884","http://service.real.com/realplayer/security/12102010_player/en/","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1024861"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0271.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0270","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0270.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-4386","title":"RealNetworks RealPlayer 堆内存破坏远程代码执行漏洞","description":"RealNetworks RealPlayer 及 RealPlayer SP 在处理特制 RealMedia 视频文件时存在堆内存破坏漏洞。由于对畸形媒体文件中的数据结构缺乏正确的边界检查，远程攻击者可诱导用户打开恶意 RM 文件触发堆内存损坏，成功利用可实现任意代码执行或导致拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 RealPlayer 11.0 至 11.1、RealPlayer SP 1.0 至 1.1.4、Linux RealPlayer 11.0.2.1744 及 HelixPlayer 1.0.6 等版本，CVSS 评分 9.3，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2010-4386"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-12-14T16:00:04Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:24:41Z","remediation":"立即升级 RealPlayer 至 12.0.1.609 或更高版本；Linux 用户将 HelixPlayer 升级至包含 RHSA-2010:0981 补丁的版本。如无法升级，在浏览器中禁用 RealPlayer 浏览器插件（nphelix.so 及相应的 ActiveX 控件），并避免打开来源不明的 RealMedia 视频文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://labs.idefense.com/intelligence/vulnerabilities/display.php?id=883","http://service.real.com/realplayer/security/12102010_player/en/","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2010-0981.html","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1024861","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8a32d285d75465c2c539e92c7500793aa7910652/cves/2010/4xxx/CVE-2010-4386.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-4386","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2010-4386.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/86ec648b067e7f3c439a59ccb9e6e448f07cc2d1/CVE/data/2010/CVE-2010-4386.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/effb2f348554323580d029ec0e691334888b7fed/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-q39j-mm6g-6jg5/GHSA-q39j-mm6g-6jg5.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2011/gb_CESA-2010_0981_HelixPlayer-uninstall_centos4_i386.nasl","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/C/centos_RHSA-2010-0981.nasl","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--ca9c6d37-1fd5-43aa-9960-ef5bb6bfa0e7.json","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/oraclelinux_ELSA-2010-0981.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2010/CVE-2010-4386.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0270.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0269","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0269.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-4385","title":"RealNetworks RealPlayer SIPR流帧尺寸整数溢出漏洞","description":"RealNetworks RealPlayer 存在整数溢出漏洞，影响 11.0 至 11.1、RealPlayer SP 1.0 至 1.1.4、RealPlayer Enterprise 2.1.2、Linux RealPlayer 11.0.2.1744 等多个版本，部分 HelixPlayer 版本也可能受影响。漏洞原理在于 RealPlayer 解析 SIPR（Sipro Lab）音频流帧尺寸时未对数值进行边界校验，导致整数溢出并可能引发内存破坏。攻击条件为远程攻击者向目标发送包含特制帧尺寸的恶意媒体文件或流数据，受害者使用受影响版本打开或播放该媒体即可触发漏洞。利用方式为无需身份认证的远程攻击，成功利用可导致任意代码执行，危害严重。RealNetworks 已在 RealPlayer 12.0.1.609 及更高版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2010-4385"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-12-14T16:00:04Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:24:41Z","remediation":"立即升级RealPlayer到12.0.1.609或更高版本，全面修复整数溢出漏洞。从控制面板中选择“程序”和“RealPlayer”，点击“修改”，然后选择“升级到Latest”。如果无法立即升级，建议禁用RealPlayer处理SIPR流的功能，可通过在注册表编辑器中找到HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SOFTWARE\\RealNetworks\\RealPlayer\\6.0\\Plugins并删除\"sipr\"值来实现临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://service.real.com/realplayer/security/12102010_player/en/","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2010-0981.html","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1024861","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8a32d285d75465c2c539e92c7500793aa7910652/cves/2010/4xxx/CVE-2010-4385.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-4385","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2010-4385.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/86ec648b067e7f3c439a59ccb9e6e448f07cc2d1/CVE/data/2010/CVE-2010-4385.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1d16110511e33acc05fa8318d8a5bd4778134123/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-2f74-hjc3-cgqp/GHSA-2f74-hjc3-cgqp.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2011/gb_CESA-2010_0981_HelixPlayer-uninstall_centos4_i386.nasl","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/C/centos_RHSA-2010-0981.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_114300_114400.json","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/oraclelinux_ELSA-2010-0981.nasl","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--90b136dd-f55a-4d96-89fb-8a707c5d47d8.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0269.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0268","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0268.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-4384","title":"RealNetworks RealPlayer 数组索引错误远程代码执行漏洞","description":"RealNetworks RealPlayer 在处理 RealMedia 文件中的媒体属性头部（MDPR）时存在数组索引错误漏洞。由于程序未对畸形 MDPR 头中的索引值进行有效验证，远程攻击者可构造特制的 RealMedia 文件，通过诱导用户打开或网站自动播放触发该漏洞，导致数组越界访问，最终实现任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 RealPlayer 11.0 至 11.1、RealPlayer Enterprise 2.1.2、Mac RealPlayer 11.0 至 11.1、Linux RealPlayer 11.0.2.1744 及 HelixPlayer 1.0.6 等多个版本，CVSS 评分 9.3，危害严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2010-4384"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-12-14T16:00:04Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:24:41Z","remediation":"立即升级 RealPlayer 至 12.0.1.609 或更高版本。Windows 用户可通过 RealPlayer 内置更新功能或从官网下载最新版安装。Linux 用户（RHEL 4）应执行 `rpm -e HelixPlayer` 卸载 HelixPlayer 包，或通过 RHN 应用 RHSA-2010:0981 更新（该更新会移除 HelixPlayer）。如无法升级，建议在浏览器中禁用 RealPlayer 插件，并避免打开来源不明的 .rm/.ram 媒体文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://service.real.com/realplayer/security/12102010_player/en/","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2010-0981.html","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1024861","http://www.zerodayinitiative.com/advisories/ZDI-10-268","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8a32d285d75465c2c539e92c7500793aa7910652/cves/2010/4xxx/CVE-2010-4384.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-4384","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2010-4384.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/86ec648b067e7f3c439a59ccb9e6e448f07cc2d1/CVE/data/2010/CVE-2010-4384.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ba518c3d2e41cb46015251f8c5b067b05ea0ba59/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-97j2-qfcm-f8wh/GHSA-97j2-qfcm-f8wh.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2011/gb_CESA-2010_0981_HelixPlayer-uninstall_centos4_i386.nasl","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/C/centos_RHSA-2010-0981.nasl","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x46000/45449/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_114300_114400.json","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/redhat-RHSA-2010-0981.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2010/AVE-2010-0268.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0267","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0267.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-4383","title":"RealNetworks RealPlayer RA5文件堆缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"RealPlayer 包含一个未指明的 RA5 文件解析堆缓冲区溢出漏洞。该漏洞影响 RealNetworks RealPlayer 11.0 至 11.1 版本、RealPlayer SP 1.0 至 1.1.4 版本、RealPlayer Enterprise 2.1.2 版本、Mac RealPlayer 11.0 至 12.0.0.1444 版本、Linux RealPlayer 11.0.2.1744 版本，并可能影响 HelixPlayer 1.0.6 及其他版本。攻击者无需身份验证即可远程向目标系统发送特制的 RA5 文件，触发该漏洞，导致堆内存被破坏，可能实现远程代码执行或导致系统崩溃。该漏洞涉及的CWE分类为堆缓冲区溢出（CWE-119）， CVSS 评分 9.3，严重威胁等级。通过精确的内存操作和精心构造的文件格式，攻击者能够绕过常规安全检测，最终夺取控制权。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2010-4383"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-12-14T16:00:04Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:24:40Z","remediation":"建议立即升级RealPlayer到12.0.1.609或更高版本以获取完整补丁修复RA5文件解析的堆溢出漏洞。如无法立即升级，可暂时禁用RealPlayer的媒体文件预览功能以降低风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://service.real.com/realplayer/security/12102010_player/en/","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2010-0981.html","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1024861","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8a32d285d75465c2c539e92c7500793aa7910652/cves/2010/4xxx/CVE-2010-4383.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-4383","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2010-4383.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/86ec648b067e7f3c439a59ccb9e6e448f07cc2d1/CVE/data/2010/CVE-2010-4383.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ba518c3d2e41cb46015251f8c5b067b05ea0ba59/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-pq35-g3gc-7vg7/GHSA-pq35-g3gc-7vg7.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2011/gb_CESA-2010_0981_HelixPlayer-uninstall_centos4_i386.nasl","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/C/centos_RHSA-2010-0981.nasl","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0