terprise 2.1.2。CVSS 评分 9.3（AV:N/AC:M/Au:N/C:C/I:C/A:C），属高危漏洞，需升级至 12.0.1.609 或更高版本修复。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2010-4380"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2010-12-14T16:00:04Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:24:40Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 RealPlayer 至 12.0.1.609 或更高版本（RealPlayer 12 及以上版本已修复该漏洞）。若暂时无法升级，请卸载 RealPlayer 或在受信任环境中禁用 SOUND 文件关联，避免打开不可信的 .snd/.au 等音频文件。企业环境可通过组策略禁用 RealPlayer ActiveX 控件（CLSID: CFCDAA03-8BE4-11CF-B84B-0020AFBBCCFA）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://service.real.com/realplayer/security/12102010_player/en/","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1024861","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7102a069678e6b88d270e4c0da51e40aee59b148/cves/2010/4xxx/CVE-2010-4380.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2010/CVE-2010-4380","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2010-4380.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5acf8b684d0e9ea76142eea6cd4851531d4ab2af/CVE/data/2010/CVE-2010-4380.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-h854-753r-9xfr/GHSA-h854-753r-9xfr.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2010/gb_realplayer_mult_vuln_win_01_dec10.nasl","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x46000/45424/info.html","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--3659e29d-e73f-4006-9c43-f82136b9fde1.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/R/realplayer_12_0_1_609.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2010/CVE-2010-4380.json